[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Not a Gold Mine]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.19]What did the team find? | 探险队发现了什么？
[00:14.25]Dreams of finding lost treasure almost came true recently. | 最近，找到失踪宝藏的梦想几乎变成了现实。
[00:20.36]A new machine called 'The Revealer' has been invented | 一种叫“探宝器”的新机器已经发明出来，
[00:25.28]and it has been used to detect gold which has been buried in the ground. | 并被用来探测埋藏在地下的黄金。
[00:32.07]The machine was used in a cave near the seashore where--it is said--pirates used to hide gold. | 这种机器在海岸附近的一个洞穴里用过，据说海盗过去常把黄金藏在那里。
[00:41.97]The pirates would often bury gold in the cave and then fail to collect it. | 海盗们过去常把黄金埋藏在洞里，但后来却没能取走。
[00:49.07]Armed with the new machine, a search party went into the cave hoping to find buried treasure. | 一支带着新机器的探测队进入了山洞，希望找到埋藏的宝藏。
[00:57.25]The leader of the party was examining the soil near the entrance to the cave when the machine showed that there was gold under the ground. | 队长正在检查洞口附近的土壤时，机器显示出地下有黄金。
[01:08.51]Very excited, the party dug a hole two feet deep. | 队员们激动万分，挖了一个两英尺深的坑。
[01:14.14]They finally found a small gold coin which was almost worthless. | 他们最后找到了一枚小金币，几乎一钱不值。
[01:20.66]The party then searched the whole cave thoroughly but did not find anything except an empty tin trunk. | 探测队随后把整个山洞彻底搜寻了一遍，除了一只空铁皮箱外什么也没找到。
[01:31.21]In spite of this, many people are confident that 'The Revealer' may reveal something of value fairly soon. | 尽管如此，很多人相信“探宝器”很快就会探测到有价值的东西。
